---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko
metaTitle: "Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko — AI in Agriculture Speaker & Trainer"
description: "Keynotes, team training and expert commentary on AI in agriculture from Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko, LinkedIn Top Voice and founder of MooMore and Petiole."
---
{% from "partials/photo.njk" import photo %}
{% set wiw = facts.award.wiw %}

<section class="hero hero--split">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <span class="eyebrow">Where Agriculture Meets AI.</span>
    <h1>AI in agriculture keynotes and team training, <span class="italic-text">from someone who builds it.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I'm Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko. I build AI for farms with MooMore and Petiole, write for a {{ facts.reach.linkedin }}
      LinkedIn community as a LinkedIn Top Voice, and help agrifood organisations see what AI can and can't do in the field.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/?type=speaking">Book Maryna to speak</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ facts.links.training }}">Train your team ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ photo(photos.conferenceTalk, sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 520px", eager=true, caption=false, class="hero__photo") }}
</section>

<ul class="proof-line">
  <li><a href="/moomore/"><strong>{{ wiw.name }}</strong>, winner</a></li>
  <li><strong>{{ facts.award.topVoice.name }}</strong>, {{ facts.award.topVoice.when }}</li>
  <li><strong>{{ facts.award.ofc.name }}</strong></li>
</ul>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <span class="eyebrow">Where I've spoken</span>
  <p class="spoken-strip">
    {%- for e in events %}{% if e.highlight and e.type == "spoken" %}<span>{{ e.organiser or e.title }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
  </p>
  <a class="text-link" href="/events/">All appearances →</a>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <span class="eyebrow">The reach</span>
  {% include "partials/reach.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="eyebrow">Three ways to work with me</span>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card card--post" href="/speaking/">
      {% set pic = photos.landscape2024 %}
      <img src="{{ pic.src }}" srcset="{{ pic.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 360px" width="{{ pic.width }}" height="{{ pic.height }}" alt="{{ pic.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>Keynotes &amp; panels</h3>
        <p>For conferences, AGMs and industry events, in person or online.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Speaking →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--post" href="{{ facts.links.training }}">
      {% set pic = photos.aiCamp %}
      <img src="{{ pic.src }}" srcset="{{ pic.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 360px" width="{{ pic.width }}" height="{{ pic.height }}" alt="{{ pic.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>Team training</h3>
        <p>Workshops and courses for agrifood teams, from 45 minutes to 12 weeks, with BASIS CPD points.</p>
        <span class="text-link">aiinagriculture.org ↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--post" href="/partner/">
      {% set pic = photos.bridgeAiStand %}
      <img src="{{ pic.src }}" srcset="{{ pic.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 360px" width="{{ pic.width }}" height="{{ pic.height }}" alt="{{ pic.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>Brand partnerships</h3>
        <p>Disclosed content and live sessions for agritech brands, for an audience that evaluates technology for a living.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Partnerships →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="eyebrow">Signature talks</span>
  <div class="speaking-topics-grid">
    {% for talk in talks %}{% if talk.homepage %}
    <div class="topic-card">
      <h3>{{ talk.title }}</h3>
      {% if talk.takeaway %}<p>{{ talk.takeaway }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p class="topic-meta"><strong>Best for:</strong> {{ talk.bestFor }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 28px;"><a class="text-link" href="/speaking/">All topics and formats →</a></p>
</section>

{% if facts.showreelUrl %}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <span class="eyebrow">Showreel</span>
  <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ facts.showreelUrl }}">Watch the showreel ↗</a></p>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section">
  <span class="eyebrow">Why listen to someone who builds it</span>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card card--post" href="{{ facts.links.petiole }}">
      {% set pic = photos.petioleDemoStand %}
      <img src="{{ pic.src }}" srcset="{{ pic.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 360px" width="{{ pic.width }}" height="{{ pic.height }}" alt="{{ pic.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>Petiole Pro</h3>
        <p>Smartphone crop measurement used by research organisations on six continents.</p>
        <span class="text-link">petiolepro.com ↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--post" href="/moomore/">
      <img src="/assets/img/women-in-innovation-2026/maryna-kuzmenko-moomore-women-in-innovation-2026.webp" width="1920" height="1080"
           alt="Innovate UK Women in Innovation Awards 2026 winner card: Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko, Founder, MooMore" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>MooMore</h3>
        <p>Thermal imaging and on-device AI to catch lameness in dairy cows before it shows. {{ facts.moomore.statusShort }}.</p>
        <span class="text-link">From crops to cattle →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--post" href="/books/">
      {% set book = books[0] %}
      <img class="card__img--contain" src="/assets/img/books/{{ book.cover }}-400.webp" width="400" height="640"
           alt="Cover of {{ book.fullTitle }} by Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="card__body">
        <h3>Books</h3>
        <p>The AI in Agriculture series: field guides on what technology actually pays back.</p>
        <span class="text-link">See the books →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}

<section class="section section--tight">
  <span class="eyebrow">Follow</span>
  <ul class="follow-links">
    <li><a href="{{ facts.newsletter.url }}"><strong>{{ facts.newsletter.name }}</strong><span>Subscribe ↗</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ facts.live.url }}"><strong>{{ facts.live.short }}</strong><span>Weekly, on understanding agricultural AI ↗</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}"><strong>YouTube</strong><span>Explainers and event recaps ↗</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section section--cta" style="background: var(--accent); color: white; border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
  <h2 style="color: white;">Planning an agrifood event or a team day?</h2>
  <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">Tell me the date and who'll be in the room. I reply {{ facts.replyTime }}.</p>
  <a class="btn" style="background: white; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 20px;" href="/contact/?type=speaking">Check availability</a>
</section>
